    <item>
      <title>Obsidian-Style Callouts Now Available!</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/posts/obsidian-callouts-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 16 Aug 2025 04:18:30 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/posts/obsidian-callouts-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;obsidian-style-callouts-now-available&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Obsidian-Style Callouts Now Available!&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#obsidian-style-callouts-now-available&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Great news! This site now supports &lt;strong&gt;native Obsidian-style callouts&lt;/strong&gt; using the excellent &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/KKKZOZ/hugo-admonitions&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;hugo-admonitions&lt;/a&gt; module. You can now write callouts exactly as you would in Obsidian!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;quick-start&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Quick Start&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#quick-start&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Simply use the standard Obsidian syntax:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;[!NOTIFY]&#xA;System notification: Your password will expire in 30 days.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The above callout will render beautifully with proper styling and icons!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
